# model-rust auto

Complementary to `/note` (Mongo `notes`) — **not a second `/note`**. Auto chat/ops under `cases` (source=`chat`). Durable decisions → `/note` (`note add`); auto turn transcript → hooks.

## When

Auto applies to **every submitted Agent prompt** (length ≥ 6), not only slash skills.
Skip short acks (`ok` / `yes` / `ยืนยัน` / …). Not every keystroke.

Hooks (workspace `.cursor/hooks.json`) stage prompt + response and **`add` on stop**
(`source=chat`, tags include `auto` + skill-or-`chat`).

Activity log (proof it ran): `.cursor/hooks/state/model-rust-auto.log`

Disable: `MODEL_RUST_AUTO=0` or `.cursor/hooks/state/model-rust-auto.off`.

## Agent must do (visible)

1. **Recall** at start of substantive work:

```powershell
agent-skills\model-rust\target\debug\model-rust.exe search --q "<keywords>" --limit 5
```

Cite `MODEL-RUST: …` (or `MODEL-RUST: none`).

2. **Persist** — hooks own `add` on `stop` (`project: agent-skills`). Agent `add` only when the log shows `FAIL`/`SKIP` or hooks are disabled:

Write `agent-skills/model-rust/tmp/last.json` then:

```powershell
agent-skills\model-rust\target\debug\model-rust.exe add --json agent-skills\model-rust\tmp\last.json
```

Include `source: "chat"`, tags `["auto", …]`, `project: "agent-skills"`. Never store secrets/URI/PII dumps.

3. Optional fail-open line when the agent ran `add` (or hooks failed): `MODEL-RUST-SAVE: <case id or reason>`.

## Commands

| Cmd | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| `ping` | connectivity |
| `search -q …` | ≤5 short hits |
| `get --id …` | one case |
| `add --json …` | insert (ids only) |
